  "solution": {
    "text": "<img src=\"assets\\st0082_c72637c99e8b.png\" style=\"height: 107px; width: 180px;\" /> <img src=\"assets\\st0082_a19f26b13912.png\" style=\"height: 146px; width: 180px;\" /><br /><br />As <math><mn>2</mn><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">m</mi></math> splits into equal parts, <math><msub><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">v</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>1</mn></mrow></msub><mo>=</mo><msub><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">v</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>2</mn></mrow></msub></math> and <math><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">&#952;</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>4</mn><msup><mrow><mn>5</mn></mrow><mrow><mn>0</mn></mrow></msup></math><br />From conservation of linear momentum,<br /><math><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">m</mi><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><mn>2</mn><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">v</mi></mrow></mfenced><mo>+</mo><mn>2</mn><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">m</mi><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">v</mi></mrow></mfenced><mo>=</mo><mn>2</mn><mfenced close=\"]\" open=\"[\" separators=\"|\"><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">m</mi><msub><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">v</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>1</mn></mrow></msub><mrow><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">cos</mi></mrow><mo>&#8289;</mo><mrow><mn>4</mn></mrow></mrow><msup><mrow><mn>5</mn></mrow><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">o</mi></mrow></msup></mrow></mfenced></math><br /><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>&#8658;</mo><msub><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">v</mi><mn>1</mn></msub><mo>=</mo><msub><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">v</mi><mn>2</mn></msub><mo>=</mo><mn>2</mn><msqrt><mn>2</mn></msqrt><mtext>v</mtext></math>"
